Thryve
======

This software is a fork and rebrand of seedypod
(https://github.com/seedypod/core), originally written by Jonathan Ng and
contributors, and licensed under the GNU Affero General Public License v3.0
only.

This fork is maintained at https://github.com/kaniick/Thryve. It keeps the
same AGPL-3.0-only license. Anyone who runs a modified version as a network
service must offer the corresponding source under AGPL §13.

