Changes in this fork
--------------------

The product has been renamed from seedypod to Thryve. Identifiers, paths,
MQTT topics (`thryve/<unit-id>/`), mDNS types (`_thryve._tcp`,
`_thryve-hal._tcp`), HomeKit manufacturer and identity (including the HKDF
salt), HTTP headers, udev paths, installer names, environment variables
(`THRYVE_*`), and release assets use the Thryve names.

A one-time migration from a seedypod v1.5.0 unit is documented in
docs/MIGRATION.md. After that migration, HomeKit must be re-paired: the
HomeKit identity salt changed, and pairings from seedypod will not work.
